Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 从那天我们 来到这世界 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ From the day we arrive on the planet ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 张开眼 去拥抱阳光 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And blinking Step into the sun ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.55,0:01:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 世界很大 总有新的风景 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ There's more to see than can ever be seen ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.88,0:02:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 每一天 总有新的挑战 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ More to do than can ever be done ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 生命旅程 等你了解 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ There's far too much to take in here ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.45,0:02:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 未来的奥妙 待你体会 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ More to find than can ever be found ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 当那旭日东升 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ But the sun rolling high ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.15,0:02:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 划过蔚蓝天空 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Through the sapphire sky ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.63,0:02:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 天地万物 随日夜变换 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Keeps great and small on the endless round ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.38,0:02:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这生命的循环 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It's the circle of life ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.79,0:02:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你我在其中 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And it moves us all ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.93,0:02:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 失望与希望 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Through despair and hope ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.58,0:02:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱与信仰 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Through faith and love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.08,0:02:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 终会有一天 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Till we find our place ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.55,0:02:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 找到你的方向 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ On the path unwinding ∮
