Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 找到你的方向 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ On the path unwinding ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.05,0:04:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 生命循环 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ In the circle ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.07,0:04:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 是生生不息 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The circle of life ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.02,0:20:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我将会是万兽之王 敌人们要戒备 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm gonna be a mighty king So enemies beware ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 就数我最出风头 先王都比不过 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm gonna be the main event Like no king was before ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.53,0:20:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我练习威严的模样 和我的狮子吼 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm brushing up on looking down Working on my roar ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.92,0:20:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 等不及成为狮子王 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, I just can't wait to be king ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.09,0:20:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没有任何吩咐 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ No one saying "do this" ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.60,0:20:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不受任何束缚 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ No one saying "be there" ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.31,0:21:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没人敢说“不行” ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ No one saying "stop that" ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.14,0:21:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没人敢说“听我说” ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ No one saying "see here" ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.65,0:21:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 自由自在到处跑 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Free to run around all day ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.32,0:21:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 随心所欲是最好 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Free to do it all my way ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.33,0:21:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 国王不需要来请教一只小犀鸟 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Kings don't need advice From little hornbills for a start ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.76,0:21:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这孩子已经翅膀硬了 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ This child is getting wildly out of wing ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.01,0:21:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 等不及成为狮子王 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, I just can't wait to be king ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.23,0:22:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 所有人向左看 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Everybody look left ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.40,0:22:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 所有人向右看 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Everybody look right ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.99,0:22:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 无论看向哪里 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Everywhere you look I'm ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.07,0:22:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 万众瞩目是我 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Standing in the spotlight ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.42,0:22:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 让世间万物都高歌一曲 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Let every creature go for broke and sing ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.70,0:22:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 让歌声从地面传到天边 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Let's hear it in the herd and on the wing ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.44,0:22:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 让辛巴国王接受最高颂赞 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It's gonna be King Simba's finest fling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.34,0:22:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 等不及成为狮子王 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, I just can't wait to be king ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.88,0:23:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他等不及成为狮子王 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ He just can't wait to be king ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.02,0:23:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我等不及成为 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, I just can't wait ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.60,0:23:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 等不及成为 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just can't wait ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.77,0:23:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 狮子王 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ To be king ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.71,0:35:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 木法沙的时代已经过去 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Mufasa is yesterday's message ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.43,0:35:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他的统治 软弱不堪 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A clapped-out, distracted regime ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.77,0:35:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他的没落 慢慢彰显 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Whose failings undoubtedly presage ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.90,0:35:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 王国需要新的道路 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The need for a dif'rent dream ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.82,0:35:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没错 狮子的王国正在变天 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Yes, leonine times are a-changing ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.03,0:35:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 鬣狗也需要跟上脚步 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Which means that hyenas must too ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.16,0:35:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我的眼前已有宏大的图景 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ My vision is clear and wide-ranging ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.29,0:35:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你们也是其中一部分 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And even encompasses you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.34,0:36:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 准备好 前所未有的政变 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ So prepare for the coup of the century ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.76,0:36:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 准备好 迎接阴险的侵袭 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Prepare for the murkiest scam ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.01,0:36:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这周详的谋划 这细致的安排 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Meticulous planning Tenacity spanning ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.77,0:36:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 数十年的蛰伏 我终于要成百兽之王 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Decades of denial Is simply why I'll Be king Undisputed ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.04,0:36:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 名正言顺 备受崇敬 万众膜拜 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Respected Saluted ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.82,0:36:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 见证新国王的时代 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And seen for the wonder I am ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.44,0:36:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 是的 我的尖牙与野心已暴露 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Yes, my teeth and ambitions are bared ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.74,0:36:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 快准备 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Be prepared ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.91,0:36:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 快准备 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Be prepared ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.96,0:36:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 快准备 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Be prepared ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.75,0:36:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 快准备 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Be prepared ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.34,0:36:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 快准备 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Be prepared ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.43,0:36:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 是的 我的尖牙与野心已暴露 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Yes, our teeth and ambitions are bared ∮
