Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.78,0:55:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 多美妙的词语 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ What a wonderful phrase ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.82,0:55:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 哈库呐 玛塔塔 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Hakuna matata ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.07,0:55:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 它简单又好记 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It ain't no passing craze ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.75,0:55:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 从现在开始 没有烦恼忧虑 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It means no worries For the rest of your days ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.54,0:55:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这是我们的 快乐主义 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It's our problem-free Philosophy ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.21,0:55:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 哈库呐 玛塔塔 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Hakuna matata ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.73,0:55:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 当他还是小疣猪 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ When he was a young warthog ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.53,0:55:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那小疣猪就是我 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ When I was a young warthog ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.83,0:55:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 发现自己的气味不受欢迎 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ He found his aroma lacked a certain appeal ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.58,0:56:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 每顿饭后都会让人难以忍受 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ He could clear the savannah after every meal ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.50,0:56:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 别看我的皮厚 其实内心娇柔 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm a sensitive soul Although I seem thick-skinned ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.42,0:56:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我好伤心 我的朋友都嫌我臭 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And it hurt that my friends never stood downwind ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.60,0:56:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 真丢脸 他非常自卑 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And, oh, the shame Yes, he was ashamed ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.85,0:56:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我想过要改名字 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I thought of changing my name ∮
