Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.05,0:59:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没有烦恼忧虑 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It means no worries ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.46,1:15:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在丛林中 茂盛的丛林 狮子正在熟睡 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ In the jungle, the mighty jungle The lion sleeps tonight ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.43,1:15:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在丛林中 安静的丛林 狮子正在熟睡 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ In the jungle, the quiet jungle The lion sleeps tonight ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.20,1:15:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在村庄旁 平和的村庄 狮子正在熟睡 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Near the village, the peaceful village The lion sleeps tonight ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.08,1:15:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在村庄旁 宁静的村庄 狮子正在熟睡 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Near the village, the quiet village The lion sleeps tonight ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.39,1:18:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 事实已在眼前 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I can see what's happening ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.14,1:18:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他俩 却没发现 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And they don't have a clue ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.89,1:18:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他们会相爱 一切都将改变 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ They'll fall in love And here's the bottom line ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.85,1:18:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 三人行剩我俩 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Our trio's down to two ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.65,1:18:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那甜蜜暧昧的暮光 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The sweet caress of twilight ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.90,1:18:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱情四处弥漫 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ There's magic ev'rywhere ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.78,1:19:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 让浪漫温馨充满每一处 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And with all this romantic atmosphere ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.41,1:19:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 灾难即将出现 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Disaster's in the air ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.92,1:19:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这夜晚 爱情到来 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Can you feel The love tonight? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.42,1:19:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如此美丽平静 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The peace the evening brings ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.01,1:19:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 整个世界 此刻完美和谐 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The world for once in perfect harmony ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.10,1:19:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 众生与之共鸣 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ With all its living things ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.69,1:19:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 太多话想对她说 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ So many things to tell her ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.74,1:19:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如何才能表明 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ But how to make her see ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.16,1:19:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我过去的真相 我恐怕 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The truth about my past? Impossible ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.83,1:19:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 她会离我而去 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ She'd turn away from me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.71,1:19:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他在犹豫 在逃避 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ He's holding back, he's hiding ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.63,1:19:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但我却不明白 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ But what, I can't decide ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.84,1:19:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 为什么他不愿做狮子王 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Why won't he be the king I know he is? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.42,1:20:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 成为真正的自己 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The king I see inside? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.89,1:20:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这夜晚 爱情到来 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Can you feel the love tonight? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.73,1:20:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如此美丽平静 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The peace the evening brings ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.36,1:20:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 整个世界 此刻完美和谐 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The world for once in perfect harmony ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.61,1:20:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 众生与之共鸣 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ With all its living things ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.29,1:20:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这夜晚 爱情到来 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Can you feel The love tonight? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.21,1:20:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 无需寻寻觅觅 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You needn't look too far ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.76,1:20:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你能感受 就不用再怀疑 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Stealing through the night's uncertainties ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.18,1:20:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱就在当下 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Love is where they are ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.27,1:20:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如果他们 坠入爱河 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And if he falls in love tonight ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.82,1:21:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 结果已注定 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It can be assumed ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.74,1:21:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 开心日子 从此变历史 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ His carefree days with us are history ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.41,1:21:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 友谊化为泡影 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ In short, our pal is doomed ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.22,1:28:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 生灵 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Yeah Spirit ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.23,1:28:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 追寻天空的启示 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Watch the heavens open ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.53,1:28:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 生灵 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Spirit ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.03,1:28:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 感受它的召唤 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Can you hear it calling? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.55,1:29:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 生灵 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Spirit ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.01,1:29:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 追寻天空的启示 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Watch the heavens open ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.73,1:29:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 命运悄悄走近 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Your destiny is coming close ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.57,1:29:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 勇敢迎战 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Stand up and fight ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.41,1:29:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 别害怕去未知远方 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ So, go in to a far-off land ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.58,1:29:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 成就自己万兽之王 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And be one with the great I am ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.74,1:47:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 终会有一天 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Till we find our place ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.08,1:47:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 找到你的方向 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ On the path unwinding ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.83,1:47:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 生命循环 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ In the circle ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.13,1:47:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 是生生不息 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The circle of life ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.63,1:47:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 生生不息 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Circle of life ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.35,0:04:48.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,《狮子王》
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.02,1:47:46.71,Title,0,0,0,0,,《狮子王》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.12,0:06:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.15,0:06:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不公平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not fair…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说是吧 小东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is it, my little friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的生来不愁吃喝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}While some are born to feast…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.67,0:06:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的却活在阴暗的角落里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}others spend their lives in the dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨些残羹剩饭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}begging for scraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.47,0:06:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way I see it…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.76,0:06:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是一样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.27,0:06:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都在寻找出路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both want to find a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.69,0:06:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王驾到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king approaches!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是演习{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.94,0:06:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下要找你严肃地谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty has requested an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.86,0:06:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会他进来的时候 你必须起身向他行礼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upon his entrance, you will rise and genuflect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.32,0:06:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙祖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zazu…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.83,0:06:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害我的午餐跑掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've made me lose my lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.33,0:06:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好向陛下解释清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will answer to Mufasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.04,0:06:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上为什么不去参加仪式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for missing the ceremony this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.62,0:06:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I answer to no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.29,0:06:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scar?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.96,0:06:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.00,0:06:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀疤 刀疤 刀疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scar? Scar. Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.05,0:06:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 够了 别那样看着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Don't look at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.26,0:06:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你饿不饿 沙祖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hungry, Zazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.22,0:06:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起吃顿饭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could have a bite together!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.60,0:07:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.18,0:07:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能吃我 这是违法的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't eat me! It is forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.22,0:07:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能吃荣耀王国的大臣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to eat a member of the king's court!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求你了 停止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! No, please! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.65,0:07:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王屈尊来找我这平头百姓了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look who's come down to mingle with the commoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.11,0:07:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和莎拉碧没看到你参加辛巴的介绍仪式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarabi and I didn't see you at the presentation of Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是今天吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that today?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.71,0:07:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定是忘掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must've slipped my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.00,0:07:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然我绝不是要藐视陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I meant no disrespect towards His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.63,0:07:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是莎拉碧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Sarabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.26,0:07:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,您是知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.92,0:07:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一向非常的敬重…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have tremendous respect for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.30,0:07:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,王后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.43,0:07:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为国王的弟弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the king's brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.51,0:07:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该站在第一位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you should've been first in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.64,0:07:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原本就是第一位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was first in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.89,0:07:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你忘了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.27,0:07:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是那位宝贝小王子插在我前面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is, until the precious prince arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.11,0:07:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要背对着我 刀疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't turn your back on me, Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:08:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 木法沙 是你不要背对着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, Mufasa, perhaps you shouldn't turn your back on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.37,0:08:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在挑衅我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做梦也不敢挑衅你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't dream of challenging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不敢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.33,0:08:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,算你聪明 你根本不是陛下的对手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wise decision. You are no match for His Royalness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.75,0:08:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,要说聪明 我的确有狮子的智慧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, as far as brains go, I got the lion's share.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.97,0:08:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可要论力量 恐怕我这位大哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when it comes to brute strength, I'm afraid my big brother…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.47,0:08:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,会永远地稳坐王位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will always rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是永远 刀疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not always, Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.60,0:08:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,将来 会由我的儿子继承王位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, it'll be my son who rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.73,0:08:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴会成为你的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba will be your king.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.73,0:08:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿国王万岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then long live the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.03,0:08:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该拿他怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I gonna do with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.11,0:08:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了吧 我们都知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. We both know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他早就该被赶出荣耀王国了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he should've been expelled from the Pride Lands long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.37,0:08:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的亲弟弟 沙祖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my brother, Zazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.37,0:08:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是他的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is his home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.75,0:08:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我还是国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I am king,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.58,0:08:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点就不会改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that will never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,家家都有个不省心的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's one in every family, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.83,0:08:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个表亲以为自己是啄木鸟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a cousin who thought he was a woodpecker.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.54,0:08:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,总喜欢用头撞树{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He slammed his head into trees,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.17,0:09:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的喙可没有那么结实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our beaks aren't built for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他动不动就脑震荡 您走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was concussed regularly. Oh, you've gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下 要回去了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sire, coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,[科萨语]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.33,0:10:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.63,0:10:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,[科萨语]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.71,0:11:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 你醒了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.26,0:11:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 快起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.01,0:11:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.14,0:11:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 爸爸 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, Dad, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.43,0:11:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子醒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.56,0:11:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,天亮前他算你儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before sunrise, he's your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.13,0:11:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点爸爸 该走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dad, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.71,0:11:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说今天会带我巡视王国的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said I could patrol with you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天已经到啦 你答应过的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And today has started. You promised!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.18,0:11:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你起来了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.94,0:11:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们开始吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.52,0:11:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 开始吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's first?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.48,0:11:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,下令大家去捕猎吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give orders for the hunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.84,0:11:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是赶走入侵者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chase away evil intruders?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 你走错方向了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! You're going the wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.44,0:11:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不应该来这么高的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not supposed to go up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.07,0:12:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,阳光照到的地方都是我们的国土{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything the light touches is our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.46,0:12:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都归你统治吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rule all of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.04,0:12:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.63,0:12:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是国王的统治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a king's time as ruler…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就如同太阳有升有落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}rises and falls like the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.21,0:12:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, Simba…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.09,0:12:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会随着夕阳一同落下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sun will set on my time here…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.05,0:12:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你会随着朝阳升起 成为新的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and will rise with you as the new king.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有这一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.23,0:12:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会归我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will belong to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.06,0:12:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切不归谁所有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belongs to no one,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.10,0:12:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是需要你来守护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but will be yours to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.77,0:12:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一项重大的责任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.15,0:12:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,阳光照到的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything the light touches?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.28,0:12:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些树{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those trees?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.11,0:12:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那个水潭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the watering hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.07,0:12:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,远处的山丘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.87,0:12:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边… 阳光照不到的地方呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And beyond those shadows?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝不可以去那个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must not go there, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王不是想干什么都可以吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought a king could do whatever he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,占领任何地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take any territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.29,0:13:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些统治者只想着占有和夺取{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}While others search for what they can take…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.51,0:13:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的国王思考如何做出贡献{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a true king searches for what he can give.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.76,0:13:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,万物是在微妙的平衡中共存{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you see exists together in a delicate balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.56,0:13:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为国王你必须了解这种平衡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As king, you need to understand that balance…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.98,0:13:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊重所有的生命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and respect all the creatures…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.53,0:13:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,从爬行的蚂蚁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the crawling ant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.65,0:13:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,到跳跃的羚羊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the leaping antelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.36,0:13:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是爸爸 我们不是吃羚羊吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dad, don't we eat the antelope?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.37,0:13:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.78,0:13:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来给你解释一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们死后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we die,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体就会变成青草{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}our bodies become the grass…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.67,0:13:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而羚羊是吃草的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the antelope eat the grass…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以在生命的循环里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so we are all connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.63,0:13:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是互相有关联的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the great circle of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.51,0:13:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.55,0:13:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,早 沙祖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, Zazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.01,0:13:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,要做晨间报告吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have the morning report?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.55,0:13:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,十只火烈鸟非要搞特立独行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten flamingos are taking a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.27,0:13:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,两头长颈鹿抱着脖子亲热{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two giraffe were caught necking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜜蜂悄悄议论花豹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The buzz from the bees… is that the leopards are in a bit of a spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.81,0:13:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不想学捕猎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready for some fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.19,0:13:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,小鸟们清晨四点就喳喳叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The birds are tweeting at 4:00 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.15,0:14:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说行啦 知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm like, "Birds, we get it."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量压低身子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay low to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.78,0:14:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.82,0:14:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,判断风向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.19,0:14:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,观察影子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the shadows…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.49,0:14:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待最好的时机扑上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wait for the perfect moment to pounce.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.16,0:14:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,狒狒们气得发狂 我就说吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now the baboons are going ape. Of course, as I say,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,贪心从来没好“豹”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}cheetahs never prosper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.12,0:14:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的至理名言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.66,0:14:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗 我再说一遍 贪心从来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you get… I'll say it again. Cheetahs never…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.54,0:14:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.59,0:14:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在做报告呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the news!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.72,0:14:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得非常好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.39,0:14:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.72,0:14:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下 有鬣狗非法越界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sire! Hyenas in the Pride Lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.18,0:14:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在大肆捕猎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're on the hunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.82,0:14:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉碧在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Sarabi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她正带头驱赶鬣狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's leading the charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙祖 带辛巴回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zazu, take Simba home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.21,0:14:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 带我去 我要帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, let me come! I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.05,0:14:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.97,0:14:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和其他小狮子待在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay with the other cubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.89,0:14:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经不小了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not a cub.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.72,0:14:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.18,0:14:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.70,0:15:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,到家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.16,0:15:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快过去 找小伙伴玩去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you go along and play with the other cubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.96,0:15:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.71,0:16:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要猎杀成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wish to kill something…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.55,0:16:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好藏在下风处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might want to stay downwind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.93,0:16:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会捕猎 刀疤叔叔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how to hunt, Uncle Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.93,0:16:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好咱们的天敌不是甲虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's hope we're never attacked by a beetle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.97,0:16:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,回自己的窝里待着 辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to your den, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.27,0:16:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不照顾小宝宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't babysit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.94,0:16:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,小宝宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babysit?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将来要成为这里的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be the king of Pride Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.32,0:16:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸带我看了整个王国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad showed me the whole kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.03,0:16:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将会统治一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said I'm going to rule it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.19,0:16:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那样吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.24,0:16:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.32,0:16:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是国王 就得给你下达命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I'm king, I'll have to give you orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.41,0:16:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥你做事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.37,0:16:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这多奇怪啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How weird is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.46,0:16:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真难以想象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.13,0:16:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸带你看过整个王国了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, your dad showed you the whole kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带你看过北边的阴暗地带吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he show you the shadows beyond the northern borders?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.34,0:16:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 他说我绝对不能去那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He said I can't go there. Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.60,0:16:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸说的完全正确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.93,0:17:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大象墓地太危险了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An elephant graveyard is no place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.60,0:17:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小王子不能去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a young prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.69,0:17:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里真有大象的墓地吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An elephant graveyard? Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.03,0:17:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的太多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear. I've said too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.70,0:17:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我猜你早晚会发现那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though I suppose you'd have found out sooner or later…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.91,0:17:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟你是要当国王的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you being king and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.78,0:17:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你去过吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.03,0:17:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都去过 真的不适合小狮子去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all been there. And it's no place for a cub.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.71,0:17:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是腐烂的尸骨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those rotting bones…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.37,0:17:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,臭气熏天 满地烂泥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and burning pools of oozing mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,腐烂的尸骨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rotting bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.63,0:17:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,满地烂泥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oozing mud?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我不要去那里 辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me you'll stay away, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.13,0:17:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去玩吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you run along.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And remember…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.18,0:17:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的小秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's our little secret…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.19,0:17:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.41,0:17:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜娜 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nala! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.95,0:17:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.62,0:17:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.58,0:17:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,水潭那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watering hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.49,0:17:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴 她还在洗澡呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba, she's having her bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.83,0:18:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你也该洗个澡了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's time for yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.16,0:18:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Mom…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.58,0:18:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己会洗澡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.04,0:18:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.67,0:18:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我的毛弄乱啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're messing up my mane!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.21,0:18:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实点 耳朵后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Behind the ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.76,0:18:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.59,0:18:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 我干净了 我们能去了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? All clean. Can we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.60,0:18:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会遇到鬣狗的 你都把他们赶走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no hyenas. You just chased them all off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.27,0:18:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在水潭附近玩 不许跑远了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to the watering hole and no further.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.61,0:18:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万待在下风处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And stay downwind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.73,0:18:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个小条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one more little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.53,0:18:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙祖 跟你们一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zazu will be going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.69,0:18:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙祖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.86,0:18:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙祖跟着 不然哪儿也别去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zazu goes… or you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.04,0:18:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快跟上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along. Keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.33,0:18:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家一起行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move in a unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.87,0:18:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 结伴而行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, buddy system.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.37,0:18:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说 我们到底去哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where are we really going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.63,0:18:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你最讨厌水了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hate the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说了一个地方 娜娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard about this place, Nala.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.92,0:18:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直不可思议 特别神奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most incredible, amazing…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.51,0:18:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快告诉我是哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me where.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.93,0:18:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,大象的墓地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An elephant graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.72,0:19:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. How far is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.76,0:19:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不远了 就在阴暗地带附近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not far. Just to the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是别怕 听说大家都去过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't worry, everyone's been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.77,0:19:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没去过那么远 迷路了怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've never been that far before. What if we get lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.23,0:19:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心吧 娜娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, Nala.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.56,0:19:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上我和爸爸巡视了整个王国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I patrolled the entire kingdom this morning with my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.98,0:19:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么可担心的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.57,0:19:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还有个麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there is one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.90,0:19:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险等级提高 有东西在逼近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have an imminent threat. Something is approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.95,0:19:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 是我自己的影子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait, scratch that. That's my own shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.29,0:19:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么甩掉那个笨蛋呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we getting rid of the dodo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.33,0:19:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我有办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.21,0:19:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我奔向自由吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me to freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们太可爱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, how lovely it is…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.59,0:19:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see the future king.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.34,0:19:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着他未来的王后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with his future queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.92,0:19:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,暖萌得我都想换毛了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could just molt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.30,0:19:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么未来的王后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "future queen"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.93,0:19:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,将来你们俩会心心相印{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, one day the two of you will be betrothed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.89,0:19:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,海誓山盟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.26,0:19:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,天长地久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Affianced.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.85,0:19:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的什么鸟语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba, you speak bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.27,0:19:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Married!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.48,0:19:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 你们会结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. One day you will be married.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.48,0:19:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为夫妻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.57,0:19:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是不可能的 沙祖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna happen, Zazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.74,0:19:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对 不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.70,0:19:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜娜是我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nala and I are friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.07,0:20:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说了 她那么害怕犀牛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And besides, she's afraid of rhinos!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.45,0:20:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他连黑斑羚都没吃过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's never eaten an impala.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.62,0:20:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尝过一口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tried it once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能结婚的 沙祖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are never getting married, Zazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.20,0:20:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟然这样无视传统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A monarch who ignores tradition?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.29,0:20:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你这种态度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With an attitude like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕你会变成一个相当悲惨的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid you'll be a pretty pathetic king.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.54,0:20:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会让别人告诉我要去哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not letting anyone tell me where to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要做什么 要和谁结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what to do… and even who to marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.59,0:20:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要做个不一样的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will never be a king like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.42,0:20:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴 你逃避不了注定的命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba, you can't escape your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.68,0:20:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看着吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.93,0:20:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有一个狮子王 才这么几根毛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've never seen a king of beasts With quite so little hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.62,0:20:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样的吼声 还差得远呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thus far a rather uninspiring thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.00,0:20:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的路还长着呢 小王子 如果你觉得…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have rather a long way to go, young master. If you think…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.59,0:20:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 当我说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, when I said that…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.13,0:20:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I meant was…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.10,0:21:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now see here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个有点儿过分了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's definitely out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候和你坐下来好好谈一谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's time that you and I arranged a heart-to-heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要这样统治 我可不奉陪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is where the monarchy is headed, count me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,辞职不干 离开草原{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of service Out of Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.13,0:21:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't hang about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.51,0:21:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.31,0:21:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.57,0:21:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到你 辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see you, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.53,0:21:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须时刻在我的视线范围内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be in my sight at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.53,0:22:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟丢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.76,0:22:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们打什么主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.31,0:22:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要去哪里 辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going, Simba?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.48,0:22:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.90,0:22:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要想着躲开我 辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't hide from me, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.61,0:22:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发过誓要保护你的安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my sworn duty to keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.73,0:22:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你倒是听我说啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You listen to me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 在各位面前扇翅膀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to flutter about in your face,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.33,0:22:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有没有看到一只小狮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have you seen… He's a little lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.95,0:22:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很小 也很可爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's small, but he's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.43,0:22:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还早呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.23,0:22:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.24,0:23:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.34,0:23:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.55,0:23:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,木法沙一定会把我撕了的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mufasa's gonna have my feathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.92,0:23:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下我可惨了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.93,0:23:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真把他给甩了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba, we really lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.56,0:23:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在想什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.31,0:23:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来的国王真了不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The future king is a genius."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.73,0:23:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好意思说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.02,0:23:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是王后帮你 你根本出不来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would've never gotten away without your queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.40,0:23:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你忘记了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you forgetting something?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.06,0:23:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要王后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.86,0:23:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一点我同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.98,0:23:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁可嫁给一头土猪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather marry an aardvark.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.69,0:23:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要看土猪乐不乐意娶你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck finding one that will say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.49,0:23:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心我让你鼻青脸肿地回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck getting out of here without a bruising.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.32,0:23:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你试一试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.54,0:23:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,输了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pinned ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.66,0:23:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欠我一个道歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.37,0:23:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.22,0:24:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又输了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pinned ya. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.97,0:24:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜娜 别闹了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nala, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.39,0:24:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.51,0:24:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别想骗我 辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna trick me, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.22,0:24:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边肯定什么也没…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that there's nothing…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.06,0:24:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定就是这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.69,0:24:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.09,0:24:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴 我们已经离家太远了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba, we're way beyond the Pride Lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.46,0:24:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了 娜娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found it, Nala.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.71,0:24:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道这说明什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.72,0:24:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明我们该回家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means we can go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.18,0:24:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明他们再不能把我们当小狮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means they won't treat us like cubs anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.44,0:25:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴快下来 可能会有危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba, get down! It could be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.77,0:25:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.36,0:25:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险来了我会放声大笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I laugh in the face of danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.74,0:25:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.91,0:25:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见了吗 娜娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that, Nala?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.28,0:25:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴 快走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.79,0:25:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经证明你很勇敢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've proved how brave you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.50,0:25:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳要下山了 我不想待在这儿…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the sun is going down, I'm not just gonna sit here and…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.44,0:26:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来瞧瞧啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.59,0:26:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到今晚有客来访{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We weren't expecting guests today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.26,0:26:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两只小狮子要不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you two cubs…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.39,0:26:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来吃晚饭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like to stay for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.64,0:26:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 留下来吃晚饭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, stay for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.60,0:26:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们俩长得就像…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.73,0:26:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜宵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a midnight snack!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.73,0:26:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能和我保持一点距离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you just give me a little bit of space?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.40,0:26:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.27,0:26:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前说好了的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have talked about this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.07,0:26:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,由我打头阵 我来吸引注意力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come in alone. I'm the lead distraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.23,0:26:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们悄悄地包围{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so everyone can circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.78,0:26:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.53,0:26:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.03,0:26:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别光说抱歉 快行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be sorry. Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.87,0:26:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这顿晚饭我可是等了大半辈子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is a meal I've waited my whole life for.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.87,0:26:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做梦也没有想到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What an unexpected treat,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.42,0:27:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,能吃上国王儿子的肉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to eat the son of a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.88,0:27:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 国王 就是那个谁吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second, the king? As in you-know-who?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.80,0:27:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,统治王国的那个吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who rules you-know-where?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.22,0:27:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不受木法沙的统治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mufasa does not rule me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.55,0:27:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能把我怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do anything to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.85,0:27:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是未来的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I'm the future king!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.73,0:27:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还想命令我呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's telling me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.60,0:27:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么硬气 还真像他爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His father's strength flickering inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.48,0:27:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真想尝尝…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.03,0:27:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的骨头是不是也这么硬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how all that bravery will taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.03,0:27:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,放过他们 桑琪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them go, Shenzi!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.91,0:27:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们犯错了 错得很严重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made a mistake, a horrible mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.87,0:27:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你要是这么干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.12,0:27:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是向木法沙国王宣战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will start a war with Mufasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.04,0:27:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬣狗和狮子从来就是敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hyenas and lions have been at war since the beginning of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.83,0:27:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天就让木法沙的血脉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Mufasa's bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.92,0:27:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,终结于此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will end here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.54,0:27:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.47,0:27:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他们跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let them get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.82,0:28:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.38,0:28:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.01,0:28:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是未来的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future king!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.97,0:28:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吃我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't hurt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.84,0:28:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,再吼一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.05,0:29:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们胆敢再靠近我的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ever come near my son again…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.59,0:29:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会了 木法沙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Mufasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.68,0:29:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.26,0:29:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不敢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.64,0:29:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就警告过你了 桑琪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been warned, Shenzi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.36,0:29:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你很勇敢呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were very brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.44,0:30:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙祖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.44,0:30:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先把娜娜送回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take Nala back to Pride Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.03,0:30:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.90,0:30:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,您别太责备他 陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be too hard on him, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.95,0:30:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经也有一只小狮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember a cub,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.37,0:30:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一样任性又倔强 总是追求冒险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a certain headstrong cub… who was always getting into scrapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.50,0:30:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.04,0:30:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也成了好国王 是吧 陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he achieved some prominence, did he not, sire?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.96,0:30:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须要给儿子上一课{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to teach my son a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.76,0:30:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜娜 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nala, come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.14,0:30:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.62,0:31:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你故意违抗我的命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deliberately disobeyed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.71,0:31:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.96,0:31:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会死掉 而且更糟的是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have been killed. And what's worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.59,0:31:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害娜娜有生命危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you put Nala in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.88,0:31:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这有多严重吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand what's at stake?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.22,0:31:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能会危及族群的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You jeopardized the future of our pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.10,0:31:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想向你证明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.64,0:31:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做得到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.31,0:31:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以像你一样勇敢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I could be brave like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.52,0:31:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只在必要时才会勇敢 在别无选择时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only brave when I have to be, when there's no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.94,0:31:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 你什么都不怕呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not scared of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.77,0:31:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天就怕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was today.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.57,0:31:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.53,0:31:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我害怕会失去你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I thought I might lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.33,0:31:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来国王也会害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess even kings get scared, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.87,0:31:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想象不到我有多害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than you could ever know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.21,0:31:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你知道吗 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But guess what? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.25,0:31:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得那些鬣狗更害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think those hyenas were even scareder.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.88,0:31:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为谁都没有胆子惹你爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 'cause nobody messes with your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.01,0:31:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.02,0:32:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.23,0:32:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们是好朋友 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're pals, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.27,0:32:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.28,0:32:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会永远在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll always be together…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.57,0:32:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.07,0:32:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴 我爸爸以前对我说过这样的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba, let me tell you something my father told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.91,0:32:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看那些星星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.04,0:32:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去那些伟大的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The great kings of the past…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.46,0:32:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那些星星上看着我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}look down on us from those stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.75,0:32:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.21,0:32:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以每当你寂寞的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whenever you feel alone…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.55,0:32:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就想想…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.30,0:32:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,死去的国王永远在天上指引你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that those kings… will always be up there to guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.18,0:32:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也一样会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.77,0:32:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么看不到他们呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't see them, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.73,0:32:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,用心看 儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep looking, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.94,0:32:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,用心看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.14,0:33:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,木法沙太强了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mufasa is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.89,0:33:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我们强壮太多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, way stronger than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.06,0:33:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要私人空间 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please give me some space. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.85,0:33:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,能躺的地方多的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could lay anywhere in this cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.61,0:33:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要我… 我需要空间 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you want me to… I need some personal space. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.28,0:33:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.45,0:33:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是瞧不起你 你也不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to take anything away from you. You were great.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.57,0:33:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他真的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he is…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.78,0:33:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了 你就是跟我过不去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, now I know you're doing this on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.91,0:33:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好威风 强悍 精力充沛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very brave, too. Tough, good energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.62,0:33:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样真的很烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're just being spiteful.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.83,0:33:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作也帅气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good posture.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.54,0:33:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次让我碰到木法沙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time I see Mufasa…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.08,0:33:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要狠狠教训他 叫他一辈子忘不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna teach him a lesson he will never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.08,0:33:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的机会来啦 他就在你背后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're in luck! He's right behind ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.92,0:34:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,木法沙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mufasa?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.48,0:34:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,来的不是国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.40,0:34:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些蠢货把这里吃得寸草不生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fools have stripped your land of every living thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.03,0:34:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好不容易送来两只小狮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet I send two little cubs your way…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.99,0:34:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们却让他们活着回去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they come back alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.74,0:34:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你来找死 吃你也一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we'll have to eat you instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.37,0:34:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,何必吃我这一顿呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why eat one meal…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.33,0:34:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能让你们下半辈子不愁吃喝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you can be feasting the rest of your lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.08,0:34:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么好处给我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could you possibly offer us?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.00,0:34:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以让你们吃饱肚子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A place where you can fill your bellies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.84,0:34:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡是阳光照到的地方你们都能猎杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where everything the light touches is yours for the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.09,0:34:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣耀王国又不是你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Pride Lands are not yours to give.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.26,0:34:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是木法沙掌管捕猎地带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king controls those hunting grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.98,0:35:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're going to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.74,0:35:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,木法沙从不允许我们痛快地猎食其它动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mufasa has always shown too much restraint… when it comes to hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.41,0:35:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是国王…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I am king…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.75,0:35:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让你们想吃多少就吃多少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the mighty will be free to take whatever they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.46,0:35:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道鬣狗的肚子永远填不满{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because a hyena's belly is never full.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.17,0:35:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,木法沙太强大了 不可能战胜他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mufasa's far too powerful to challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.66,0:37:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上次惹得爸爸特别生气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad was pretty upset with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.04,0:37:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们才要到这儿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're here, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.25,0:37:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道有个办法能让你弥补过错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know a way for you to make it up to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.33,0:37:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一份礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.50,0:37:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让他再也不追究那天的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that will make him forget it ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.09,0:37:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他是国王 我能送他什么呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's the king. What could I give him?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.01,0:37:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的吼声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your roar.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.51,0:37:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的吼声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My roar?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.64,0:37:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.05,0:37:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.10,0:37:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有狮子都来这个峡谷练习吼叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This gorge is where all lions come to find their roar.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.98,0:37:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有狮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All lions?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.48,0:37:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸也来过吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.65,0:37:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸像你这么大的时候也来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Mufasa came here when he was your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.32,0:37:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不停地练习{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Refused to leave…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.82,0:37:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后他的吼声一直传到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until his roar could be heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.32,0:37:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,峡谷上面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}above the rim.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.49,0:37:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直传到峡谷上面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the way up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.91,0:37:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候就算练成了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when you know you've found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.08,0:38:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要稍加练习{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a little practice…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.29,0:38:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没人敢再叫你小狮子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll never be called a cub again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.50,0:38:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.38,0:38:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会成功的 辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get it, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.42,0:38:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,多练练就好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just takes time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.76,0:38:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一会儿再来看你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check on you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.39,0:38:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸一定会非常骄傲 是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad will be so proud, won't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.18,0:38:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这份礼物 他到死都忘不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a gift he'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.42,0:40:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,木法沙 快去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mufasa! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.30,0:40:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,角马群奔进了峡谷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stampede in the gorge!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.80,0:40:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴还在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba's down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.18,0:40:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.18,0:40:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.96,0:40:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙祖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.00,0:40:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住 国王马上来救你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on! Help is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.34,0:40:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那儿 那棵树上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is! On that tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.81,0:41:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了 辛巴 抓紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming, Simba! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.40,0:41:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去帮他 沙祖 你去通知大家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll help them, Zazu! You get the pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.11,0:41:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.18,0:41:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.22,0:41:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.09,0:41:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我这儿来 儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to me, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.34,0:41:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.45,0:42:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.63,0:43:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scar!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.55,0:43:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉我一把{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.73,0:43:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿国王…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long live.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.56,0:43:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,万岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.65,0:43:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.59,0:43:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.35,0:43:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.92,0:44:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.51,0:44:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.65,0:44:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来呀 你醒醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.69,0:44:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.45,0:44:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来救我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.19,0:45:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.48,0:45:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.28,0:45:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大一群角马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.82,0:45:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸想救我 这是个意外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to save me. It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.70,0:45:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是故意的 你当然不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean for it to… Of course you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.54,0:45:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会故意造成这种事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one ever means for these things to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.46,0:45:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,可国王毕竟死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the king is dead…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.13,0:45:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是因为你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if it weren't for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.38,0:45:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'd still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.88,0:45:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸对你抱着多么大的希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father had such hopes for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.93,0:45:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,给了你那么多机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}gave you so many chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.10,0:45:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你就这样报答他吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is how you repay him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.56,0:46:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我没想到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know. I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.27,0:46:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈会怎么想呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what will your mother think?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.44,0:46:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为儿子 害死了父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A son who causes his father's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.73,0:46:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为王子 害死了国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A boy who kills a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.28,0:46:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么办呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.66,0:46:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.37,0:46:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑得远远的 辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run away, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.75,0:46:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.25,0:46:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且永远别回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and never return!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.14,0:46:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.18,0:47:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去看看 确认他死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go down and make sure he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.94,0:47:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又忘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.52,0:47:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.73,0:47:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住保持这个距离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good distance right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.03,0:47:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.49,0:47:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,小狮子掉下去肯定死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No little cub could survive that fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.66,0:47:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 待会就对她说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we're gonna tell her…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.24,0:47:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们下去看了 然后… 把他吃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we went down there and we ate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.58,0:47:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 我都快饿死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's perfect, 'cause I am starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.29,0:47:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是真的吃他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna eat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.92,0:47:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴已经死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.38,0:47:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就这么告诉桑琪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all she ever has to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.76,0:47:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你便{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.23,0:48:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,木法沙国王死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}SCAR: Mufasa's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.86,0:48:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是可怕的悲剧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a terrible tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.73,0:49:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是最伟大的荣耀国国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The greatest leader the pride has ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.07,0:49:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去了大哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To lose a brother…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.74,0:49:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,心中感到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}such a deep,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.33,0:49:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,深切的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.91,0:49:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,悲痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.20,0:49:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有可怜的辛巴 他的生活才刚刚开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And little Simba, who had barely begun to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.17,0:49:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,小王子本应是狮群的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cub whose blood held our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.80,0:49:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,想到这一点 让我更加难以承受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost too much to endure.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.01,0:49:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我多希望当时能早点赶到峡谷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only wish I had gotten to the gorge in time…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.34,0:49:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶到他们身边救起他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}been there to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.56,0:49:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今我不得不怀着悲痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so it is with a heavy heart…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.73,0:49:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,担起责任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.73,0:49:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,继承王位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}assume the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.31,0:49:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,木法沙和辛巴都死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mufasa and Simba are gone…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.53,0:49:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means I.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.24,0:49:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你们的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}am your king.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.70,0:49:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须承认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I must admit…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.37,0:49:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法独自担负这个重任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot bear this burden alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.54,0:49:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要盟友的帮助 来守护…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will need some help… to ensure.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.63,0:49:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣耀王国的安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the safety of the pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.43,0:50:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜娜 跟紧我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nala, stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.64,0:50:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,今后… 我们要从悲痛中振作起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, from the ashes of this tragedy…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.73,0:50:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,迎接一个崭新时代的来临{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we shall welcome the dawning of a new era.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.61,0:50:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,走向伟大的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.44,0:50:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,光明的… 未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and glorious future!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.00,0:50:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.63,0:50:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,[科萨语]
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.24,0:52:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,又没逮到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.41,0:52:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天我要逮一只秃鹰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get one of those vultures one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.53,0:52:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要逮到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get one!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.37,0:52:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不懂你为什么这样执着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why it's so important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.83,0:52:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为逮着了会让我有成就感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just feel like it would make me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.00,0:52:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一头小狮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. It's a little lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.50,0:52:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是狮子 那你看看是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not a lion. Well then, go check it out. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.79,0:52:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不是狮子 是毛茸茸的大鸟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not a lion, it's a furry bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.75,0:52:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像狮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like a lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.84,0:52:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这哪儿是狮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.80,0:52:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我仔细瞧一瞧 借过一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get a closer look. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.96,0:52:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们看看这到底是个什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let me see what we're dealing with here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.88,0:52:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是狮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.97,0:52:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快逃命啊 彭彭 你等一下 丁满{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run for your life, Pumbaa! Wait! Hey, Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.39,0:52:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跑 丁满 等等 他只是头小狮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Timon, wait! It's a little lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.35,0:52:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会长大的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gets bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.72,0:52:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他回家吧 咱们养他好不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we keep him? Can we please keep him?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.52,0:52:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我保证我会天天遛他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, oh, okay. I promise I'll walk him every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.94,0:52:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的吃喝拉撒 我会处理好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he makes a little mess, I'll clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.44,0:52:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会被他吃掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be his little mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.44,0:52:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把你吃了 然后用我当牙签{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna eat you and then use my body as a toothpick!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.61,0:53:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是将来 等他长大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one day, when he's big and strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.24,0:53:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是咱们这边儿的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll be on our side!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.28,0:53:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.36,0:53:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他变成我们这边儿的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if he's on our side?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.70,0:53:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.95,0:53:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一头凶悍的狮子在身边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having a ferocious lion around.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.03,0:53:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这主意或许还不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}might not be such a bad idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.99,0:53:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们能养他吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then, can we keep him?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.54,0:53:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 当然可以养他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course we can keep him!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.29,0:53:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的 到底谁说了算啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, who is the brains of this operation?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.83,0:53:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就叫他“飞来的”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna name him Fred!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.88,0:53:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.30,0:53:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩救了你的命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we're the guys who saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.72,0:53:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒着危险赶走了可怕的秃鹰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Risked everything. Fought off angry vultures!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.09,0:53:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多秃鹰 乌压压的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hordes of them. Flocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.05,0:53:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是彭彭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.18,0:53:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫丁满{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.89,0:53:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗 我们救了你的命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I mention that we saved your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.60,0:53:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.35,0:53:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他受了什么打击 连命都无所谓了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. How bleak is that? It doesn't even matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.69,0:53:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我操的心还不够多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I don't have enough that I'm dealing with, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.23,0:53:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要死要活也归我管吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now his problems are my problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.53,0:53:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们可以帮他啊 他是我们这边的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can help him. We're in a position to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.74,0:53:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以… 你怎么了 请用一句话概括下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how are you, in as few words as possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.12,0:53:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了很可怕的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did something terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.20,0:53:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不想跟你们说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.25,0:53:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着孩子 谁都犯过错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, kid, we've all made mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.62,0:53:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们多少能帮点儿忙 是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, there must be something we can do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.84,0:54:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你们能够改变过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not unless you can change the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.00,0:54:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道这不可能 的确不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, that's a lot to ask… That's pretty hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.80,0:54:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去怎么改啊 太难了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if I'm being honest. I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.22,0:54:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的都过去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}change the past? It already happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.22,0:54:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 你改变不了 但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so you can't change that. But.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.39,0:54:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以改变…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know what you can change?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.56,0:54:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.72,0:54:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的专长 我同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our specialty. Kind of our thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.18,0:54:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有发生的事情要怎么改变呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you change something that hasn't happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.85,0:54:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.73,0:54:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想改变未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to change the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.90,0:54:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须把过去抛到脑后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gotta put your past behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.52,0:54:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,抛得远远的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.57,0:54:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 小狮子 坏事常常有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, kid, bad things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.94,0:54:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本拿它没办法 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can't do anything about it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.49,0:54:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.24,0:54:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.41,0:54:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是世界和你过不去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the world turns its back on you…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.12,0:54:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就让世界一边儿去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you turn your back on the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.91,0:54:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,转身去迎接新的一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And only embrace what's next!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.16,0:54:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,把“怎么办”变成“又怎么样”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And turn the "what" into "so what?"
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.41,0:54:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 我以前学的不是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's not what I was taught.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.88,0:54:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你也许应该学点新知识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then maybe you need a new lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.79,0:54:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一起念 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat after me, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.30,0:54:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.01,0:54:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛塔塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.80,0:54:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 哈库呐 玛塔塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Hakuna matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.01,0:54:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库呐 玛塔塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuna matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.14,0:54:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库呐 别人听到都很兴奋的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuna Most people get a bigger reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.26,0:54:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人听了立马激动得拍巴掌 哈库呐 玛塔塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people start clapping immediately. Hakuna matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.77,0:54:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是“无忧无虑” 预备…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means "no worries." One and a…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.39,0:54:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来打拍子 可我想数拍子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. I do the counting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.40,0:55:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想… 数拍子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna count!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.40,0:55:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不就一起来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we count together?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.77,0:55:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那一起来 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's a good idea. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.07,0:55:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One and a two and a…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.30,0:55:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库呐 玛塔塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuna matata?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.60,0:55:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是我们的座右铭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's our motto.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.31,0:55:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是座右铭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a motto?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.43,0:55:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓 你管它是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothin'. What's-a-motto with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.06,0:55:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice. Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.27,0:55:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这几个字能够解决你所有的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those two words will solve all your problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.11,0:55:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 拿彭彭举例来说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Take Pumbaa here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.52,0:55:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.62,0:55:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧 提起来就伤心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you feeling? It's an emotional story.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.43,0:56:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我陪在你身边 其实也不情愿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was always here for you and I resent that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.14,0:56:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,改成什么 香香猪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, to what, "Brad"?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.44,0:56:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要阻止我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.94,0:56:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我才不要 你恶心死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not! You disgust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.96,0:56:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 唱下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sing it, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.77,0:57:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到寒舍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to our humble home.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.98,0:57:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们住在这儿吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.31,0:57:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想住哪儿就住哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we live wherever we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.90,0:57:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们随心所欲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do as we please.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.27,0:57:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里好漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.52,0:57:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是还不错吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's really nice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.19,0:57:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 这是辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, this is Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.20,0:57:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看清楚吗 他是头狮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, my friend, is a lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.03,0:57:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他吃什么 你没拿什么喂他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about food? Have you thought about feeding that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.58,0:57:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我饿了 能吃下一匹斑马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm starved! I could eat a whole zebra.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.50,0:57:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.54,0:57:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 孩子 这里没有斑马肉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, kid, we're fresh out of zebra.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.50,0:57:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有羚羊吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any antelope?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.34,0:57:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 听着孩子…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, listen, kid…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.54,0:57:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我们住 就得跟我们吃一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you want to live with us, you have to eat like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.80,0:57:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And most importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.55,0:57:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能吃我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not eat us!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.26,0:57:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里像是可以弄到昆虫的好地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This looks like a good spot to rustle up some grub!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.81,0:57:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 让一让 各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! It's perfect! Step aside, fellas!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.35,0:57:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.69,0:57:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嚼不烂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too chewy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.44,0:57:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只吃起来像坚果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's got some nuttiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.81,0:57:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只的味道够鲜美的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's what I call umami!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.27,0:57:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,粘粘的 但是很解馋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slimy, yet satisfying.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.61,0:57:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嚼起来脆脆的 本地产的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extra crunchy. They're local.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.99,0:57:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Oh, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.95,0:57:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是从那儿来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're from right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.49,0:57:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听我说 孩子 这种生活最棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling ya, kid, this is the great life.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.87,0:57:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有规则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.08,0:58:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有责任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.29,0:58:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是夹馅流心的 我超爱吃这种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! The little cream-filled kind. I love these!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.25,0:58:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种挺好的 最好吃了 我超爱吃这种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are good. I love these. Those are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.96,0:58:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,头能给我吗 尝尝吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I have the head? Well, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.42,0:58:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.80,0:58:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库呐 玛塔塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuna matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.72,0:58:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,粘粘的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slimy…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.35,0:58:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是… 很解馋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet satisfying.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.76,0:58:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说吧 没骗你哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it! We didn't lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.81,0:58:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫卵 我找到好多虫卵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Egg sac! I got an egg sac!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.65,0:59:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,再一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.65,0:59:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我觉得够了 这一遍唱得好棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, I think we did it. Yeah. I think we got this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.74,0:59:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才刚刚找对感觉 算了 听多就腻了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're just getting in the groove, guys. No, let's leave 'em wanting more.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.28,0:59:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都从小唱到这么大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you've grown 400 pounds since we started.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.33,0:59:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是一点都没变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile I look exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.04,0:59:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,能叫他歇会儿吗 是你坚持要唱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you tell him to stop? But you insisted we sing the song.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.21,0:59:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坚持 明明是你先唱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I insisted? You started singing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.21,0:59:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是咱们的成名作 不应该随便唱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's our signature song… we shouldn't be sharing it with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.04,0:59:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因为是成名作 我们才要…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's our signature song, so we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.80,0:59:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 快叫他别唱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just tell him to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.51,0:59:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还发挥了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}now he's riffing, Pumbaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.51,0:59:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听 真是一场噩梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.09,0:59:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他唱得越来越好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It actually is becoming better and better.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.64,1:00:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nala.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.85,1:00:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.06,1:00:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.82,1:00:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙祖 你去哪儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zazu, where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.57,1:00:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 娜娜 我已经尽快赶回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Nala. I came as soon as I could.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.66,1:00:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,汇报一下 沙祖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The morning report, Zazu.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.67,1:00:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,王后陛下 荣耀王国处境非常危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, the Pride Lands are in imminent danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.84,1:00:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬣狗就要把动物们赶尽杀绝了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hyenas are chasing off the last of the herds.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.84,1:00:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只鸟回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bird's back!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.47,1:00:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.05,1:01:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢再回来 我一口把你吃掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't come here again, unless you want to be eaten!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.16,1:01:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得做些什么 王后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to do something, Sarabi.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.25,1:01:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要反抗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.54,1:01:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nala.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.13,1:01:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀疤现在是国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scar is the king.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.30,1:01:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可您是我们的王后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are our queen!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.05,1:01:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该趁早离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should leave before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.34,1:01:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须留在这里守护荣耀王国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must all stay together and protect the Pride Lands.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.60,1:01:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our home.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.14,1:01:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝不能轻易放弃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must never abandon it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.31,1:01:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这不是我记忆中的家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't the home I remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.52,1:01:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会有转机的 娜娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our time will come, Nala.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.48,1:01:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,要耐心一些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be patient.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.81,1:01:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉碧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarabi.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.94,1:01:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王说要见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king wishes to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.49,1:01:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.32,1:02:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不害怕他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not afraid of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.92,1:02:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,要和我一起吃吗 莎拉碧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't you join me, Sarabi?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.51,1:02:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物还多着呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's plenty to go around.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.60,1:02:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在过度捕猎 刀疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're overhunting, Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.56,1:02:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是提高了捕猎效率{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've simply perfected the kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.48,1:02:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也帮了忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the help of my army.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.35,1:02:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是在无节制地滥杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're killing everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.35,1:02:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看到吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.86,1:02:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在谁也不敢违抗我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nobody to challenge me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.15,1:02:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想要什么就有什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can finally take whatever we want.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.15,1:02:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.65,1:02:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,想当年 你选择了木法沙而不是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long ago you chose Mufasa over me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.45,1:02:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在我当了国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now there is a new king.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.04,1:02:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就别这么自私了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So stop being so selfish.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.54,1:02:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,自私的是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the selfish one.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.46,1:02:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别的狮子都听你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other lions look to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.63,1:02:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不低头 他们就不会服从我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as you resist they will reject me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.34,1:02:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧站到我身边来 一起享用猎物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your place by my side, and we will feast together.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.38,1:03:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会做你的王后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never be your queen!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.39,1:03:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then from now on…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.93,1:03:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只能吃鬣狗剩下的食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the lions will eat after the hyenas.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.27,1:03:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别指望他们剩下多少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they don't leave much behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.78,1:04:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不睡觉想干什么 小姑娘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just what do you think you are doing, young lady?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.87,1:04:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让开 沙祖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away, Zazu.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.58,1:04:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去寻找帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to find help.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.33,1:04:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我走开 你想都不要想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will very much not go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.33,1:04:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发过誓要保护你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sworn to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.75,1:04:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我命令你回去睡觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and must order you back to bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.92,1:04:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经不需要保护了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need protecting anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.72,1:05:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀疤 真高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scar! Uh, wonderful to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.56,1:05:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思半夜来找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sorry to drop in like this!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.56,1:05:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前有没有给你讲过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I ever told you about.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.64,1:06:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我表哥 他以为自己是啄木鸟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}my brother who thought he was a woodpecker?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.04,1:06:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nala…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.35,1:06:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要抓住你 我要抓住你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm gonna get ya! I'm gonna get ya!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.86,1:06:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,差一点 就差一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I got ya!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.70,1:06:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴 是你啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba! It's you!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.95,1:06:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了吗 刚才那只蝴蝶就在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that? Man, that butterfly was right there!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.00,1:06:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点就抓住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost had him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.29,1:06:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为是狮子 不是你这种狮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was a lion. You know, the other kind of lion.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.63,1:06:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是真正的狮子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, a real lion?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.04,1:06:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说你是假狮子 不过狮子会吃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, not that you're not a real lion. But you know, the kind that eats…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.67,1:07:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.80,1:07:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.43,1:07:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,要一起吃虫子吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna get some grubs?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.72,1:07:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这是怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with that guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.93,1:07:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, Simba…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.19,1:07:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我怎么说呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I say this?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.06,1:07:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是吃草的 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's prey. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.36,1:07:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他跟你这个吃肉的家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he is never gonna want to frolic.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.32,1:07:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩不到一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a carnivore.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.56,1:07:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是永远玩不到一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You two will never frolic.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.73,1:07:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.48,1:07:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看啊 万事万物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, in nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.15,1:07:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,都维持着微妙的平衡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a delicate balance.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.78,1:07:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 生命的循环 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. The circle of life. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.82,1:07:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 错了 错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.41,1:07:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道你从哪里听来的循环的说法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where you're getting "circle" from.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.16,1:07:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命根本不是循环 没有什么循环{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no circle of life. No, it's no circle.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.20,1:07:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 绝对不是 其实…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not at all. In fact,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.12,1:07:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好相反 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's the opposite. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.37,1:07:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命是一条线 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a line. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.62,1:07:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条无情又无意义的直线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a meaningless line of indifference.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.17,1:07:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从线的起点走向终点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're all just running towards the end of the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.92,1:07:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,等有一天走到了尽头 就彻底完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then one day we'll reach the end, and that'll be it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.84,1:07:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,完蛋了 线断了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Line over!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.38,1:07:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,到头儿了 没有了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Nada.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.34,1:07:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要管好自己 为自己考虑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can really just kinda… do your own thing and fend for yourself…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.64,1:07:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你的线连不上别人的线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause your line doesn't affect anyone else's lines.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.64,1:07:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,活着活着就死了 就像这家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alive and then you're not. Like this guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.60,1:08:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的不是循环吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure it's not a circle?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.56,1:08:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们彼此没联系吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we're all connected?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.23,1:08:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我们全都有联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A circle would mean we're all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.86,1:08:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我做的事会影响到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would mean what I do affects him…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.36,1:08:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,影响到这家伙 不对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}affects that thing. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.61,1:08:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那个 不是这样的 那样的话…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Affects that thing. That's not how it goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.28,1:08:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,随心所欲地生活就不酷了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which would make doing whatever we wanted not that cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.41,1:08:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来给你总结一下吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me simplify this for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.16,1:08:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命是没有意义的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life is meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.29,1:08:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你只要管好自己就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. That's why you just gotta look out for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.08,1:08:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要做自己 辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you do you, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.62,1:08:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 辛巴 我今天破个例{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Simba, for the first time…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.29,1:08:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你来决定咱们怎么度过这一整天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're entrusting you to make a plan for us today.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.59,1:08:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事很重要 想想我们教你的道理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is important. Think about all you've been taught.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.30,1:08:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说你自己想做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you wanna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.09,1:08:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还用说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.89,1:08:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都不做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.43,1:08:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 他明白了 中大奖啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly! He gets it! Jackpot!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.18,1:08:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,让一下 让一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of my way! Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.39,1:08:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好脆呀 太好了 开饭啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crunchy! All right! Time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.12,1:09:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Hello!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.62,1:09:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,打得真响亮 辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice one, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.83,1:09:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢了 肯定是白蚁吃多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thanks. Must've been the termites.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.21,1:09:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是蟋蟀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the crickets.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.79,1:09:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你理解我为什么喜欢睡在地下了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you wonder why I prefer to sleep underground.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.59,1:09:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Timon.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.26,1:09:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有好奇过那些发光的小点点是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you ever look up there and wonder what those sparkly dots are?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.14,1:09:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭 我不好奇 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Pumbaa. I don't wonder. I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.14,1:09:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? What are they?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.27,1:09:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是萤火虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.06,1:09:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,被扣在那个大大的蓝黑色罩子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fireflies that got stuck on that big, bluish-black thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.36,1:09:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得有道理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.32,1:09:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直以为它们是一团团气体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought they were balls of gas.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.57,1:09:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在很远的地方燃烧着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}burning billions of miles away.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.07,1:09:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭 你怎么说什么都要扯上臭气啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa, why is everything always gas with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.45,1:09:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.45,1:09:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢 辛巴 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, Simba? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.37,1:09:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.87,1:09:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过有人跟我说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But somebody once told me…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.33,1:09:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有很多逝去的伟大国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the great kings of the past are up there…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.96,1:09:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在看着我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're all watching over us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.51,1:09:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个笑话好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good one!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.14,1:10:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑死我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's insane!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.93,1:10:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑死我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's insane!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.89,1:10:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群死掉的国王在看着我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Royal dead guys watching over us!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.14,1:10:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿他们别从天上掉下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hope they don't fall out of the sky!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.48,1:10:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧点 各位陛下 别掉下来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, Your Majesty! Don't let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.94,1:10:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样乐子可就大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that would be a mess.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.73,1:10:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,太逗了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.61,1:10:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说辛巴 你想想看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Simba, think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.82,1:10:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么一帮国王要看着我们呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would a bunch of kings be looking out for us?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.36,1:10:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们算什么 我是皇家小猪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're outcasts. Royal warthogs!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.53,1:10:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,受不了了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.28,1:10:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的受不了了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.24,1:10:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,受不了了 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. No,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.58,1:10:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受得了 我受不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.46,1:10:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.75,1:10:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.04,1:10:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这种想法…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.34,1:10:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的挺傻的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.05,1:10:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先走了 去弄点虫子什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go get some grubs or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.18,1:10:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他说什么了 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say to him? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.81,1:10:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的时候 我就感觉他不太对劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you were saying it, I thought, "This won't end well."
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.15,1:10:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果你还使劲儿傻笑 你也笑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just start laughing. You laughed too.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.11,1:10:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才没有 我绝不会笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not. I would never.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.53,1:10:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I blew it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.92,1:14:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.93,1:14:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴 还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba is alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.48,1:14:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,[科萨语]
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.82,1:16:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好了 彭彭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.27,1:16:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快逃命啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run for your life!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.94,1:16:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 彭彭 跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, Pumbaa, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.49,1:16:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon, help!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.12,1:16:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.25,1:16:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.54,1:16:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要死啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.71,1:16:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来救你 彭彭 坚持住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming, Pumbaa! Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.51,1:16:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 让开 让开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.02,1:16:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.77,1:16:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好 不好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.77,1:16:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.54,1:17:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nala?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.79,1:17:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.67,1:17:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的是你吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that really you?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.59,1:17:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.80,1:17:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是辛巴 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me, Simba!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.47,1:17:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜娜 你怎么在这儿 我不是做梦吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nala, what're you doing? Oh, my… I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.35,1:17:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.64,1:17:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.93,1:17:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大概不会被吃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you're getting eaten.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.81,1:17:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑哪儿去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.56,1:17:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.02,1:17:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为他死了 我还以为我死了呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought he was dead. I thought I was dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.98,1:17:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点被你吃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were gonna eat me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.53,1:17:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好玩了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What fun!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.57,1:17:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我想先问一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, before we move on,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.41,1:17:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩怎么认识的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do you two know each other?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.74,1:17:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 彭彭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon, Pumbaa…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.78,1:17:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来见见我最好的朋友 娜娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to meet my best friend, Nala.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.20,1:17:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好的朋友 我好伤心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best friend? Well, that hurts.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.62,1:17:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜娜你肯定会喜欢这儿的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nala, you're gonna love it here!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.08,1:17:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是个好地方 想要什么东西都有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is amazing. It's everything you could ever want.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.63,1:17:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴 你得跟我回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba, we need to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.50,1:17:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀疤带着鬣狗群占领了王国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scar has taken over with the hyenas.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.92,1:17:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须回去 夺回王位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to take your place as king.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.01,1:17:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,王位 辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}King? Simba?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.64,1:17:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,您忠诚的仆人向您致敬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kneel before you as loyal servants.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.14,1:18:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭 别闹 她搞错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa, relax. She's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.10,1:18:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘 我看你是找错狮子了 说的好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady, you've got your lions crossed. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.73,1:18:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,能再见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing you again,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.02,1:18:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道这对大家意味着什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't know what this will mean to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.48,1:18:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我又意味着什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What this means to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.82,1:18:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得跟我回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to come home.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.03,1:18:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是我的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my home.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.07,1:18:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.16,1:18:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿真的特别棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.70,1:18:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you'll love it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.70,1:18:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.04,1:18:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.54,1:18:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少让我带你到处转转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least let me show you around.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.54,1:18:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.88,1:18:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴 这地方太美了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba, it's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.22,1:18:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.85,1:18:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's "they"?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.90,1:18:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.03,1:18:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.74,1:18:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ev'rywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.10,1:21:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说吧 这地方很棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you. Isn't it great here?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.65,1:21:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许可以永远这样过下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, maybe it could be like this forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.94,1:21:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.90,1:21:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我有件事想不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's something I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.36,1:21:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你根本就没有死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you've been alive all this time…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.82,1:21:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不回家呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}why haven't you come home?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.70,1:21:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真的很需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've really needed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.08,1:21:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没我才好 娜娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're fine, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.62,1:21:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有谁需要我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody needs me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.25,1:21:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你是国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the king.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.04,1:21:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜娜 刀疤才是国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nala, Scar is the king.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.11,1:21:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴 刀疤毁掉了荣耀王国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba, he's decimated the Pride Lands.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.28,1:22:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有食物 也没有水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no food, no water…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.20,1:22:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没有办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.37,1:22:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想过你妈妈吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about your mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.08,1:22:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,守护王国是你的责任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.12,1:22:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须去挑战刀疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to challenge Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.58,1:22:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远都不能回去 永远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go back. Ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.58,1:22:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.04,1:22:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为峡谷里发生的事吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of what happened at the gorge?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.92,1:22:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀疤告诉我们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scar told us that…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.13,1:22:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会明白的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't understand!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.42,1:22:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些都不重要 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of it matters. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.09,1:22:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈库呐 玛塔塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuna matata.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.76,1:22:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.51,1:22:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我在这儿学到的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something I learned out here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.64,1:22:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多时候不好的事情发生了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, sometimes bad things happen,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.47,1:22:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你什么也做不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's nothing you can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.27,1:22:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 何必担心呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why worry?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.06,1:22:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,何必担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why worry?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.02,1:22:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.02,1:22:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是我认识的那个辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the Simba I remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.44,1:22:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回不到从前了 现在你满意了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I never will be. Are you satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.44,1:22:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我现在很失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.40,1:22:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说… 你说话的口气好像我爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, now you're starting to sound like my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.53,1:22:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 至少我们还有一个像他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. I'm glad one of us does.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.95,1:22:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不知道我经历了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what I've been through!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.54,1:22:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这儿是想寻找帮助的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came here looking for help.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.92,1:22:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看样子我是想错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.42,1:22:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.02,1:23:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还对我失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Disappointed"?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.90,1:23:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想让我回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants me to go home?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.74,1:23:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿就是我家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am home.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.74,1:23:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么好朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Best friend"?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.45,1:23:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要朋友 我谁都不需要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need best friends. I don't need anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.12,1:23:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,从不需要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never did.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.34,1:23:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,[科萨语]
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.60,1:23:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.73,1:23:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开并不能解决问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going away will not answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.69,1:24:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么问题 你是谁啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What question? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.28,1:24:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚自己是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know exactly who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.53,1:24:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是… 你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.99,1:24:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我谁也不是 所以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm nobody. So.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.87,1:24:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别烦我了 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}leave me alone. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.87,1:24:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有身份 即使是无名小卒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody is somebody. Even a nobody.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.25,1:24:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我看你是糊涂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think you're confused.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.09,1:24:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我糊涂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am confused?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.13,1:24:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连自己是谁都不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.09,1:24:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. And I suppose you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.72,1:24:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抱过木法沙的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I held the son of Mufasa.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.56,1:24:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew my father?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.85,1:24:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correction.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.98,1:24:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.77,1:24:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸已经死去很久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.02,1:24:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.19,1:24:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以带你去见他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can take you to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.45,1:24:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来 我带你去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me. I will show you!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.20,1:24:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可要跟上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can keep up!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.03,1:24:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.00,1:24:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,[科萨语]
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.17,1:25:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.51,1:25:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点 到这儿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly, quickly! Come through!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.31,1:25:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你慢一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.31,1:25:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好快一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.73,1:25:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我来了 我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. I'm coming, I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.26,1:25:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.60,1:25:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲在等着你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.49,1:26:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see him?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.66,1:26:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也看不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.70,1:26:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,[科萨语]
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.79,1:26:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仔细看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look closer.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.46,1:26:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到他了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.38,1:26:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在你心里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.55,1:26:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.39,1:26:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.56,1:26:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.48,1:26:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须在生命的循环中找到自己的位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must take your place in the circle of life.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.82,1:26:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.03,1:26:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要记住自己是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must remember who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.70,1:26:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是真正的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one true king.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.75,1:26:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.91,1:27:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到像您一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to be like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.33,1:27:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为国王 我最自豪的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As king, I was most proud of one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.46,1:27:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是有你这个儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having you as my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.34,1:27:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那已经过去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.93,1:27:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.97,1:27:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远自豪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.81,1:27:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,求您了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.64,1:27:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再离开我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.48,1:27:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never left you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.94,1:27:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也永远不会离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And never will.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.44,1:27:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要记住你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.66,1:27:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,要记住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.25,1:27:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我再问你一遍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, I ask again.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.34,1:27:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.55,1:27:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Simba.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.68,1:27:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,木法沙的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of Mufasa.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.49,1:28:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.70,1:28:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来呀 你还在等什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.12,1:28:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回家去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go home!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.59,1:29:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前还不信你说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't wanna believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.88,1:29:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你现在要怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.22,1:29:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸要我保护阳光照耀到的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father once told me to protect everything the light touches.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.97,1:29:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不去战斗 还有谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't fight for it, who will?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.06,1:30:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.85,1:30:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场战斗会很危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.52,1:30:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danger?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.48,1:30:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险来了我会放声大笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I laugh in the face of danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.53,1:30:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是真的吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.53,1:30:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 沙祖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Zazu.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.95,1:30:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.12,1:30:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.75,1:30:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了 各位别激动 我们来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here! Oh, everyone, calm down. We're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.50,1:30:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,后援部队赶到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The backup has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.63,1:30:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个怎么来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.05,1:30:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们… 不是担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, we were not worried!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.59,1:30:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 不担心 因为不用担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not worried. 'Cause no worries.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.22,1:30:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 哈库呐 玛塔塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. Hakuna matata.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.22,1:30:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是有一点关心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were concerned,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.85,1:30:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为… 你知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, you know…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.93,1:30:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're our friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.39,1:30:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条无情又无意义的线呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the meaningless line of indifference?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.35,1:30:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 我们觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we were thinking…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.73,1:30:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条线可能拐了一点点弯 问得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe it curves a little bit. That's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.94,1:30:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Simba, look,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.94,1:30:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭说错了 我有责任指出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy to admit when Pumbaa's wrong…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.78,1:30:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这句话就说错了 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this is one of those instances. What?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.53,1:30:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我说的 明明是你说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't my thing. You told me about the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.99,1:30:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.16,1:30:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是要为这个地方战斗吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is the place you're fighting for?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.16,1:31:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 丁满 这里是我家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Timon. This is my home.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.54,1:31:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在那块可怕的石头后面吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it behind that terrifying rock?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.87,1:31:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家真得装修一下了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about your fixer-upper.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.54,1:31:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,风格还不错 就是死尸太多了点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like what you've done with it, although a bit heavy on the carcass.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.13,1:31:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看呀 有只鸟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, look. A bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.13,1:31:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁满 彭彭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timon, Pumbaa,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.88,1:31:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是沙祖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is Zazu.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.93,1:31:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是只海鸟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a puffin.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.09,1:31:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charming.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.22,1:31:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴 我们将陪你战斗到底{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba, we are with you until the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.89,1:31:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意听候您的调遣 大王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are at your service, my liege!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.56,1:31:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.54,1:31:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是鬣狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hyenas everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.00,1:31:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望能死得痛快点 别被鬣狗嚼太碎了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope it's a quick death. You know, just not a lot of chewing.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.87,1:31:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有办法绕过那些流口水的家伙吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your plan for getting us past the slobbering guards?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.71,1:31:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,用活的诱饵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live bait.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.09,1:31:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个主意不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.80,1:31:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看到新鲜的肉一定会扑上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guys could never resist fresh meat.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.97,1:32:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我们只需要找个诱饵 要够大够胖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So all we need to do is find something that's, like, big… and plump,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.93,1:32:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且够好吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and juicy.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.64,1:32:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛羚怎么样呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe like a gnu?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.10,1:32:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,干吗都看着我呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is everyone looking at me?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.73,1:32:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法语] 晚上好 美丽的小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.95,1:32:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怀着无限的热情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is with deepest pride.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.07,1:32:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,和最大的喜悦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and greatest pleasure…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.32,1:32:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣幸地献上…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we proudly present…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.66,1:32:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的晚餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.67,1:32:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,请… 用…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be our.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.92,1:32:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.22,1:32:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划成功 彭彭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working, Pumbaa!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.34,1:33:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,久违了老朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My old friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.55,1:33:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是何苦呢 莎拉碧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarabi, why put yourself through this?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.97,1:33:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要做我的王后就好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do is be my queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.52,1:33:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底放不下什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're suffering for what?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.18,1:33:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀念过去的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The memory of a life you once knew?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.35,1:33:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是放不下你爱过的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A king you once loved?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.27,1:33:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让你知道什么才叫真正的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to make you understand what a true king can be.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.86,1:33:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀疤 国王伟大的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scar, a true king's power.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.32,1:33:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在于他的同情心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is his compassion.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.57,1:33:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比那个木法沙强过十倍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am ten times the king Mufasa was!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.99,1:33:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就不配与木法沙相比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are nothing compared to Mufasa!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.17,1:33:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,木法沙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mufasa?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.47,1:33:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.55,1:33:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我妈妈远一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from my mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.47,1:33:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.48,1:34:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.60,1:34:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can that be?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.19,1:34:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.23,1:34:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.52,1:34:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴 我真高兴看到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba… I'm so happy to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.61,1:34:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.86,1:34:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好有充分的理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me one good reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.74,1:34:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我马上把你撕碎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}why I shouldn't rip you apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.12,1:34:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很多理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you more than one.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.29,1:34:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.83,1:34:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都认我为王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they think I'm king.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.75,1:34:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不承认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.92,1:34:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的统治结束了 刀疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your reign is over, Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.05,1:34:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴才是真正的国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba is the rightful king!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.80,1:34:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想对付他 就得先打败我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanna get him, you have to get through us.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.47,1:34:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们同意吗 狮子们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you with me, lions?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.85,1:34:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己选 刀疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The choice is yours, Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.73,1:34:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,主动退位 还是战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step down or fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.98,1:34:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要用武力解决吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must this all end in violence?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.11,1:34:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想成为一个害死亲人的家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd hate to be responsible for the death of a family member.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.24,1:34:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,去感受那份羞耻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To feel the shame of knowing…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.74,1:35:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有害死自己至爱的愧疚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took the life of someone I love.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.08,1:35:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经放下那包袱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put all that behind me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.29,1:35:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可问题是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But have they.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.12,1:35:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家也放下了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}put it behind them?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.21,1:35:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都知道他做了什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do your faithful subjects know what you've done?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.17,1:35:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到底在说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.88,1:35:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你还没说出你的小秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you haven't told them your little secret?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.13,1:35:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧 辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Simba…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.93,1:35:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是你坦白的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}now's your chance to confess.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.14,1:35:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们 到底是谁害死了木法沙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them who's responsible for Mufasa's death.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.94,1:35:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.15,1:35:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not true.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.99,1:35:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我这不是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me it's not true.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.20,1:35:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.99,1:35:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他承认了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He admits it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.95,1:35:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.91,1:35:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是 那次是个意外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.92,1:35:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是你 国王现在还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it weren't for you the king would be alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.25,1:35:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的死都是你的错 你敢否认吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your fault he's dead! Do you deny it?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.00,1:35:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.26,1:35:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要相信杀死父亲的儿子吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should believe a son who takes the life of a father?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.18,1:35:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要相信杀死国王的王子吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should believe a son who takes the life of a king?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.80,1:36:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还抛弃了自己的母亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A son who abandons his mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.05,1:36:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我… 我是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.60,1:36:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么 说出来 你是国王吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're what? Say it! Are you the king?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.64,1:36:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I'm…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.64,1:36:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是国王吗 不 我是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you the king? No, I'm…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.40,1:36:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么 我是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're what? I'm…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.10,1:36:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.82,1:36:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.19,1:36:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就给国王跪下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then bow to your king!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.61,1:36:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.38,1:36:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一幕有点眼熟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This looks familiar.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.55,1:36:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像之前在哪里见过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have I seen this before?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.68,1:36:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 想起来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.93,1:36:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,木法沙死之前也是这个样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the way Mufasa looked before he died.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.10,1:36:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我低下头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked down…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.27,1:36:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到他眼里满是恐惧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}saw the fear in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.78,1:37:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你我的小秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here's my little secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.95,1:37:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我杀了木法沙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed Mufasa.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.58,1:37:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.17,1:37:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.42,1:37:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的亲兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your own brother!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.47,1:37:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么忍心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.84,1:37:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他先是害死了木法沙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First he kills Mufasa…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.89,1:37:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他还想杀了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now he wants to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.43,1:37:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你杀了国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed him!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.93,1:37:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them the truth!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.14,1:37:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别信他 他在撒谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't believe his lies!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.14,1:37:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scar…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.52,1:37:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说当时来不及赶到峡谷救他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you told us you didn't get to the gorge in time.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.28,1:37:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's true!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.66,1:37:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么能看到木法沙死前的眼神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how did you see the look in Mufasa's eyes?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.79,1:37:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.79,1:37:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.05,1:37:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,狮子们 攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lions, attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.27,1:38:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.62,1:38:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,彭彭 应该甩掉他们了 刚才吓死我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumbaa, I think we lost them. That was terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.20,1:38:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到吼声没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear a low growl?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.62,1:38:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们今晚有猪肉大餐了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we'll be having pig for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.42,1:38:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这猪又圆又胖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plump and chubby.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.84,1:38:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,圆胖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chubby?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.46,1:38:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是不是说我圆胖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he just call me chubby?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.46,1:38:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像听到他说我又圆又胖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounded a lot like he just said "chubby".
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.18,1:38:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他可大错特错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which would be a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.59,1:38:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我永远都不会为身材自卑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I will not be made to feel ashamed of who I am!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.93,1:38:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.31,1:38:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实有点怕鬣狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may run from hyenas…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.47,1:38:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我对霸凌绝不忍气吞声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I will always fight a bully!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.23,1:38:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉好点了吗 好点了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel better, Pumbaa? I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.61,1:38:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,情绪有宣泄出来吗 我有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that out of your system? I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.25,1:39:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这顿晚饭我等了大半辈子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is a meal I've waited my whole life for.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.63,1:39:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也等了很久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting too.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.84,1:39:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再是当年的小狮子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not a cub anymore!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.18,1:39:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为国王和王国而战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For king and country!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.06,1:39:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那只鸟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the bird!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.73,1:39:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来抓他 我来抓他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him! I got him!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.86,1:39:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tally-ho!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.15,1:39:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好 他抓住我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! No! He's got me!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.99,1:39:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got me!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.57,1:39:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住那只鸟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that bird!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.29,1:39:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我们好好谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Let's discuss this.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.38,1:39:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,[科萨语]
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.37,1:40:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这招永远都管用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That never gets old!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.32,1:41:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了 刀疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over, Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.49,1:41:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,饶过我吧 求求你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have mercy. I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.20,1:41:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,饶你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mercy?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.96,1:41:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还能求饶恕吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what you did?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.54,1:41:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是鬣狗的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the hyenas.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.38,1:41:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些吃尸体的恶心家伙逼我干的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those revolting scavengers made me do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.05,1:41:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来想把他们全杀了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was planning on killing them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.55,1:41:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗了鬣狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fooled the hyenas.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.84,1:41:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像当年骗我一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you fooled me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.47,1:42:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simba…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.97,1:42:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会杀死唯一叔叔吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wouldn't kill your only uncle.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.69,1:42:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 刀疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.69,1:42:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你不一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.07,1:42:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Simba…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.90,1:42:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是善良高尚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are truly noble.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.07,1:42:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会弥补这一切的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will make it up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.32,1:42:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我该怎么证明我自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me how I can prove myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.41,1:42:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我做什么都行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what you want me to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.33,1:42:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.79,1:42:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑得远远的 刀疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run away, Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.46,1:42:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这里 再也不要回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run away and never return.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.30,1:42:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.34,1:42:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.18,1:42:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,都听你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.43,1:42:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.28,1:42:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢不了的 刀疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't win, Scar!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.82,1:43:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的王国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.57,1:43:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我注定为王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My destiny!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.96,1:43:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.42,1:44:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要花点时间 我们就能重新夺回王位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will take some time, but together we will build our army.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.55,1:44:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是你朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Friends", huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.39,1:44:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你说 我们是吃尸体的恶心家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said we were "revolting scavengers"?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.31,1:44:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 而且你想杀了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That you wanted to kill us?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.23,1:44:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 你们听我解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.35,1:44:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想骗过他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to fool him.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.90,1:44:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们一起统治王国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will rule together!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.69,1:44:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只说对过一件事 刀疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one true thing you ever said, Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.12,1:44:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是鬣狗的肚子…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A hyena's belly…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.24,1:44:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远填不满{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"is never full."
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.13,1:44:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.10,1:45:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,参见国王陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.19,1:46:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要记住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember.
